[NB: this is not really a port-specific question, it's a question about
buildds in general...]

On Sun, Sep 05, 2004 at 04:12:00PM +0200, Max Vozeler wrote:
> Hi alpha porters!

> I hope you can help me understand what's going on with cdtool 2.1.5-10
> on alpha. The buildd page shows it as "Building" for something like two
> weeks now :

